ont-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >预占库存、收银台、支付对账</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-weight:bold;=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >订单寻源履约流程</font></span></b><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >：订单拆分</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >（拆分的场景主要有：生产维度（仓库不同、商家不同、配送方式不同</font><font face=3D"宋体" >&#183;&#183;&#183;）、业务类型维度（实物订单、虚拟订单、生鲜订单&#183;&#183;&#183;）等，</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=3DMsoNormal  style=3D"mso-pagination:widow-orphan;text-align:left;" ><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >该系统的职责是按照不同的规则将父订单拆分成多个子订单进行生产。）</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;font-size:12.0000pt;=20mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >、订单转移</font></span><span style=3D"mso-spacerun:'yes';font-family:宋体;color:rgb(255,0,0);=20font-size:12.0000pt;mso-font-kerning:0.0000pt;" ><font face=3D"宋体" >（不同的订单要执行不同的生产时机、